{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"bf7610cdfec6a827","type":"group","x":2120,"y":5933,"width":1320,"height":573,"label":"Commercial Hub"},
		{"id":"09f43512440ff58e","type":"group","x":2425,"y":4920,"width":1015,"height":600,"label":"Business Generation"},
		{"id":"882e6f0ca34f7520","type":"group","x":280,"y":5760,"width":1187,"height":459,"label":"The Workshop"},
		{"id":"6552a3c6339faf93","type":"group","x":960,"y":4920,"width":888,"height":515,"label":"Learning Lab"},
		{"id":"dec20b64e42a4615","type":"group","x":1200,"y":6520,"width":740,"height":497,"label":"Partnerships"},
		{"id":"10f715c0bf8979af","type":"text","text":"# Key Resources\n1. **AI Technology**: Advanced AI software and tools for automation, integration, and educational services.\n2. **Human Capital**: Skilled team members including AI experts, educators, developers, and operational staff.\n3. **Educational Content**: Proprietary curriculum, course materials, and edutainment content.\n4. **Brand and Intellectual Property**: The Synthminds brand, trademarks, and proprietary methodologies.\n5. **Digital Platforms**: Websites, social media accounts, and online community platforms like Discord.\n6. **Partnership Networks**: Relationships with educational institutions, technology providers, and content collaborators.\n7. **Operational Tools**: Software for project management (Notion), automation (Make.com), and customer relationship management (HubSpot).","x":-40,"y":760,"width":1320,"height":400,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"f25133faad320224","type":"text","text":"# Key Activities\n1. **Automation Engineering**: Developing AI-driven automation tools and processes to enhance operational efficiency.\n2. **Off the Shelf Integration Solutions**: Providing ready-to-use AI integration solutions for businesses and entrepreneurs.\n3. **Education**: Creating and delivering AI educational programs for various skill levels, focusing on practical application.\n4. **Research**: Conducting research to stay current with AI advancements and maintain thought leadership.\n5. **Edutainment**: Educating a broader audience about AI through engaging content on platforms like YouTube and podcasts.","x":-40,"y":440,"width":1320,"height":320,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"f037a858df185f7a","type":"text","text":"# Key Partnerships\n1. **Innervate**: Multiagent workflow automation SaaS.\n2. **Neuraldreams**: Easy-to-implement RAG stack and model tuning SaaS\n4. **Morpheme**: AI voice generation technology.\n5. **Uplimit, Yeshiva University, Juanatech**: Hybrid and certified AI educational programs.\n6. **Make.com (aspirational), Retool & Notion**: Productivity and organizational tools for operational efficiency.\n7. **Obsidian**: (Aspirational) Knowledge management solution for content and learning.","x":-40,"y":120,"width":1320,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c939148b8a67fd12","type":"text","text":"# Customer Relationships\n- **Educational Engagement**: Providing AI courses, webinars, and workshops for continuous learning and development.\n- **Community Building**: Fostering a sense of community among AI enthusiasts and early adopters through platforms like Discord and social media.\n- **Consultative Selling**: Establishing trust with mid-sized businesses by assessing AI needs and providing tailored integration solutions.\n- **Partnership and Collaboration**: Forming collaborative relationships with entrepreneurs and businesses for AI integration guidance and support.\n- **Diversity and Inclusion Advocacy**: Creating relationships centered around shared values and social responsibility by engaging in diversity initiatives.\n- **Long-term Support and Follow-up**: Offering ongoing support and follow-up services for AI integration and education.","x":-40,"y":1160,"width":520,"height":960,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0e4dfcd22b9c9a63","type":"text","text":"# Customer Segments\n1. **Mid-Sized Businesses with High ARR**: These are businesses with an annual recurring revenue (ARR) of $5 million to $50 million, particularly in the e-commerce, marketing, and SaaS sectors. They have the resources for AI integration but lack a dedicated AI department.\n2. **Adult Learners & Upskilling**: This segment targets adult learners who are looking to enhance their careers or gain a competitive edge by upskilling in the field of AI.\n3. **AI Enthusiasts & Early Adopters**: Synthminds caters to individuals with varying levels of AI knowledge, offering tiered educational products and services to meet the needs of beginners, intermediates, and advanced users.\n4. **Integration & Implementation for Entrepreneurs**: The focus here is on helping entrepreneurs integrate and implement existing AI solutions into their workflows, rather than creating bespoke solutions.\n5. **Commitment to Diversity & Inclusion**: Synthminds actively works to involve more women and people of color in the AI field through targeted programs and inclusive marketing efforts.\n6. **English-Speaking Markets with Future Expansion Plans**: Initially, Synthminds targets English-speaking regions with plans to offer multilingual support and cultural adaptations for global market expansion in the future.","x":480,"y":1160,"width":800,"height":960,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d5689229ce3b8443","type":"text","text":"Chatbot Engineer(s)","x":381,"y":5952,"width":312,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"5fac844898ed1978","type":"text","text":"Automation Engineer(s)","x":360,"y":6080,"width":354,"height":73,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e61275280f5d704e","type":"text","text":"Second Brain Engineer (s)","x":360,"y":5800,"width":360,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"2a43dbea4b12dca3","type":"text","text":"Project Manager","x":990,"y":5952,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"66260aee84274c9c","type":"text","text":"# Value Proposition\nSynthminds offers tailored AI integration and education solutions, empowering everyone - from established businesses to AI novices - with accessible, practical, and cutting-edge AI knowledge and applications for transformative growth. Here are the specific value propositions for different customer segments:\n\n1. **For Mid-Sized Business Leaders**:\n    - Enable businesses to create their own AI Center of Excellence, and develop AI policies.\n    - Assess AI needs to provide a tailored starting point for integration.\n    - Train-the-trainer programs to empower in-house teams with AI knowledge and skills.\n2. **For Adult Learners & Upskilling**:\n    - Partnerships with Uplimit and Yeshiva University Global to deliver high-quality, practical AI education, in addition to our own offerings.\n    - Focused programs for upskilling adult learners with the latest AI tools and applications.\n3. **For AI Enthusiasts & Early Adopters**:\n    - Regular updates and commentary on the latest AI news and trends, making cutting-edge information accessible and practical.\n    - Community forums and workshops to engage with AI trends and reduce information noise.\n4. **For Entrepreneurial Implementers**:\n    - Assistance in integrating AI into new or existing business models and workflows.\n    - Support services including guidance on assessing and evaluating different AI tools, applications, and objectives.\n5. **For Diversity & Inclusion Champions**:\n    - Overt efforts to amplify the diversity of women and people of color in AI, through targeted initiatives and partnerships.\n    - Go out of our way to ensure inclusivity and accessibility in AI education and integration services.\n6. **For Global Ambitions**:\n    - Use of AI itself to manage multilingual and cultural adaptability in our services.\n    - Focus on English-speaking markets initially, with plans to expand globally using AI-driven adaptability.\n\n**Additional Value Proposition**\n- Assist customers in applying for and securing funding for AI integration, offering guidance through the entire funding process.","x":1280,"y":120,"width":1480,"height":1040,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d2aae1094491d1b0","type":"text","text":"# Channels\n### Digital Channels\n- **Websites**: Synthminds.ai and Synapticlabs.ai serve as primary digital touchpoints for information and services.\n- **Social Media**: LinkedIn, Instagram, and potential Facebook presence for community engagement and brand visibility.\n- **Online Forums and Communities**: A Discord community with 303 members for real-time interactions and knowledge sharing.\n### Partnership Channels\n- **Educational Partnerships**: Collaborations with Yeshiva University Global, Uplimit, BSD Education, and Manning Publications to deliver AI education.\n### Content Marketing\n- **Goda**: YouTube channel for practical AI walkthroughs.\n- **Synthminds**: YouTube channel, blog, and podcast \"How to Talk to AI\" for AI-related content.\n- **Synaptic Labs**: Blog \"Learning about AI,\" podcast \"A Chat with ChatGPT,\" YouTube channel, and webinars on AI basics.\n### Direct Sales\n- **Inbound Marketing with HubSpot**: Utilizing HubSpot for targeted content, SEO, and lead nurturing.\n- **Upwork Engagement**: Connecting with potential clients seeking AI solutions.\n- **Word of Mouth**: Encouraging referrals based on service quality and impact.\n- **Networking and AI Conferences**: Participation in events like AI4 and VoiceAI for networking and client acquisition.\n### Additional Direct Sales Channels\n- **Kajabi**: Online courses, coaching programs, or membership sites for AI education.\n- **Gumroad**: Selling digital products related to AI.\n### Events and Workshops\n- **Free Intro to AI Webinars**: Monthly or bimonthly webinars to introduce AI concepts.\n- **Prompt Engineering Conference Collaboration**: Organizing a conference on prompt engineering.\n- **Generative AI Conference Partnership**: Hosting a conference on Generative AI.\n- **AI Bootcamps**: Intensive bootcamps for hands-on AI experience.\n- **Discord Office Hours**: Regular office hours for community support and engagement.\n### Email Marketing\n- **Synaptics Labs**: Monthly newsletters for AI enthusiasts.\n- **Synthminds**: \"Insiders\" subscription for exclusive content.","x":1280,"y":1160,"width":1480,"height":1520,"color":"6"},
